{'symbol': 'BRO', 'date': '2020-11-09 06:45:00', 'title': 'BROWN & BROWN, INC. ANNOUNCES THE ASSET ACQUISITION OF COVERHOUND AND CYBERPOLICY', 'text': 'DAYTONA BEACH, FLA., NOV. 09, 2020 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- J. SCOTT PENNY, CHIEF ACQUISITIONS OFFICER OF BROWN & BROWN, INC. (NYSE:BRO), AND KEITH MOORE, THE CEO OF COVERHOUND AND ITS WHOLLY OWNED SUBSIDIARY CYBERPOLICY (COLLECTIVELY, “COVERHOUND”), TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT A SUBSIDIARY OF BROWN & BROWN, INC. HAS ACQUIRED SUBSTANTIALLY ALL OF THE ASSETS OF COVERHOUND.'}